{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ventomori</strong> is a 3D asynchronous puzzle co-op that places you centre stage as intrepid astronauts on their way to Planet M-113, <i>Xanahspati</i>, hoping to unveil the secrets behind a mysterious distress call.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join forces to brave the unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose to be the eyes from above on the space station as the Control player or conquer your fears as you plunge headfirst towards planet Xanahspati as the Scout. Work in tandem to solve puzzles, manage your oxygen, and ensure each other\u2019s survival as you traverse. But be careful, silence here\u2026 is quite <i>deadly</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover the past, reveal the future</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Towering ruins of intrigue await in this narrative driven world. Take in the melancholic sights and deduce the history of the unseen Padullurians as you navigate around monoliths of ancient, alien technology and the planet\u2019s harsh, bone-rending winds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">If at first you don\u2019t succeed\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try and try again to hone your experience with each attempt. Draw out every last breath of your oxygen and overcome your struggles together till you reach the end. The digital bodies may fade, but the everpresent minds remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I am Puzzler Incarnate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477530/80c161d93686c6b55974323f2582f5c977a6192d.jpg"},{"name":"Me Myself And I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477530/80c161d93686c6b55974323f2582f5c977a6192d.jpg"},{"name":"After All I've Done","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477530/80c161d93686c6b55974323f2582f5c977a6192d.jpg"},{"name":"May We Meet Again","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477530/80c161d93686c6b55974323f2582f5c977a6192d.jpg"},{"name":"Trust Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477530/80c161d93686c6b55974323f2582f5c977a6192d.jpg"},{"name":"I Dont Hate Art","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477530/80c161d93686c6b55974323f2582f5c977a6192d.jpg"},{"name":"I've Seen Things You Wouldn't Believe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477530/80c161d93686c6b55974323f2582f5c977a6192d.jpg"},{"name":"Self Control Is Strength","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477530/80c161d93686c6b55974323f2582f5c977a6192d.jpg"},{"name":"Tis But a Scratch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477530/80c161d93686c6b55974323f2582f5c977a6192d.jpg"},{"name":"Serious Dedication","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477530/80c161d93686c6b55974323f2582f5c977a6192d.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3477530?t=1748847804","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/25013e69e2a3b930e7cff7db05bd5df501b1a686/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748847804","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/8557af19d4aa299c67f93a1aad6e4d5911270342/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748847804","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/8557af19d4aa299c67f93a1aad6e4d5911270342/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748847804","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null